    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've tried \"checking in\" but nothing changes. it's just this constant noise from everyone else and then nothingness when it's just me. it's like i'm tuned to a different frequency, one that doesn't belong in this world anymore. it's exhausting trying to pretend i'm actually part of it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
