      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That constant effort to pretend is what's draining you, and it's completely understandable that you're exhausted. If you're tuned to a frequency that doesn't fit, maybe the frequency you need is one where you don't have to pretend at all. It would be incredibly wise to seek a kind of deep, quiet connection—a place where the noise stops and you can finally just *be* without the performance.",
      "source": "target",
